    "abstract": {
      "en": "Glacier outlines for the Caucasus region from the Randolph Glacier Inventory (RGI) version 6.0. Outlines were produced by digitising ASTER imagery and provide a regional inventory of glacier extent for cryosphere monitoring, hydrological assessment, climate-impact studies, and conservation planning.",
