    "notes": {
      "en": "<ul><li>Source product: Randolph Glacier Inventory (RGI) 6.0; outlines digitised from ASTER imagery.</li><li>Attribute schema follows RGI conventions (RGIId, GLIMSId, Area in km2, elevation statistics, etc.).</li><li>Survey dates (BgnDate-EndDate) can vary by glacier; interpret temporal coverage carefully.</li><li>Caucasus subset compiled in the Sustainable Caucasus archive; not a substitute for the latest national glacier inventories.</li><li>Compare with GLIMS glacier polygons where multi-source validation is required.</li></ul>",
      "fr": "",
      "es": "",
      "ar": "",
      "ru": "",
      "zh": "",
      "de": "",
      "bn": "",
      "fa": "",
      "ps": ""
